$DATUM (2S,3R)-3-((tert-butyldimethylsilyl)oxy)-N-(4,5-dimethoxy-2-vinylphenethyl)-2-isobutylpent-4-enamide
(14): A solution of 1.169 g (2.030 mmol, 1.0 eq.) of amide 17 and 0.213 g
(0.812 mmol, 0.40 eq.) AsPh3 in 100 mL abs DMF was degassed for 20
minutes by bubbling argon through the mixture. Then 0.316 g (0.3451 mmol,
0.17 eq.) Pd2(dba)3 were added followed by 1.483 mL (5.075 mmol, 2.5 eq.)
of the stannane. The mixture was stirred at room temperature over night,
filtered through celite, washed with water (4 × 30 mL), dried over MgSO4,
filtered, and the solvent was removed under reduced pressure. The residue
was taken up in acetonitrile, washed with hexane (2 × 30 mL) and the
solvent was removed under reduced pressure. The crude product was
purified by flash chromatography on silica (eluent: hexane/ethyl acetate
3:1) yielding of diene 14. Colorless solid, yield 0.8544 g, 1.7960 mmol,
88%. Rf (hexane/ethyl acetate 3:1) 0.36. M.p.: 89-90 °C.[α]D23: +14.9° (c
= 1.00 in CHCl3). IR (film): 3293, 2954, 2929, 2857, 2359, 2344, 2377,
1641, 1511, 1464, 1263, 1220, 1104, 1074, 861, 836, 776. 1H-NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 7.01 (s, 1H, Harom.), 6.93 (dd, J = 7.3, J = 0.9, 1H,
Ph-CH=CH2), 6.65 (s, 1H, Harom.), 6.14 (t, J = .7, 1H, NH), 5.74 (ddd, J
= 7.0, J = 0.4, J = .6, 1H, CH=CH2), 5.55 (dd, J = 7.3, J = .2, 1H,
Ph-CH=CHcisHtrans), 5.23 (dd, J = 0.9, J = .2, 1H, Ph-CH=CHcisHtrans),
5.16 (dt, J = 7.1, J = .4, 1H, CH=CHcisHtrans), 5.09 (dt, J = 0.4, J =
.2, 1H, CH=CHcisHtrans), 4.15 (dd, J = .5, J = .5, 1H, CHOTBS), 3.88,
3.86 (2 × s, 6H, 2 × OCH3), 3.38 (m, 2H, CH2NH), 2.81 (m, 2H, CH2Ph),
2.27 (dt, J = .8, J = .0, 1H, C=OCH), 1.69 (ddd, J = 3.7, J = .4, J = .5,
1H, CH2), 1.64-1.49 (m, 1H, CH(CH3)2), 1.20 (ddd, J = 3.4, J = .5, J =
.7, 1H, CH2), 0.95-0.81 (m, 15H, SiC(CH3)3, C(CH3)3), 0.05, 0.01 (2 × s,
6H, SiCH3). 13C-NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 173.17, 149.03, 147.93, 137.91,
133.93, 129.21, 129.14, 116.29, 113.98, 112.80, 108.71, 75.58, 56.05,
56.03, 51.54, 40.49, 37.10, 33.03, 26.21, 25.91 (3 × CH3), 23.39, 22.31,
18.15, -4.20, -4.89. ESI: 476.4 ([M + H]+, C27H46NO4Si, calcd. 476.7),
499.3 ([M + Na]+, C27H45NO4SiNa, calcd. 498.7). HRMS: 476.3189 ([M + H]+,
C27H46NO4Si, calcd. 476.3191).
